{"id":"vod_hh_55731","vodId":"55731","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"MAPLESTORY","name_cn":"MAPLESTORY","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第25话","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/e3fe004c8a465494fcb14db3bb9f0ee1.jpg"},"summary":"在很久以前,大地有一棵名为世界树的圣树,魔王札特为了得到世界树的力量.而不择手段,当时世界上的人民. 包括战士村的怪物.魔法森林的怪物,弓手村的怪物,以及后来因为战争而成了废弃都市的盗贼村.以及人类村的5条村的 人民奋勇作战,可惜,战斗途中,世界树选择了自毁重生,自毁后,把种子散步在世界各地,因为圣树世界树是这个世界的支柱.所以一旦毁灭掉的话就很麻烦,在战斗中途因为发生了意外,人类村的村民被其他村的村民误解,被排挤.说世界树的自毁是人类造成的,这只是故事的开端。 　　过了10年后...5条村分别由怪物和人类分开管理,因为种族的分歧,而不断修炼,祈求得到世界树种子的神秘力量统治枫之谷,札特军团死心不惜,也加入抢夺行列,主角阿鲁,是曾经参加保护世界树人类英雄的儿子,也因为他的心,也因为札特军团的各种手段,4条村终于和解了。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-06-07 02:12:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZgD6Ra/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/5eVWyOWa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaOGoYLa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/ZdPGpNWb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb2XAkNe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/BeXPADAe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb42Dxne/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/NbW1z7Je/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penlVxRb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/xe7M7Ljb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Pe9j7Qxa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lejBVZRe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb2XAvKe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/DbDx71nb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/xbom9Vje/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16话","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/pl